    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST THE GAME!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.poster.avif?t=1744965672\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.webm?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.mp4?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/b2d95da44b902ba8dc6b4ec904b8356f.poster.avif?t=1744965672\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/b2d95da44b902ba8dc6b4ec904b8356f.webm?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/b2d95da44b902ba8dc6b4ec904b8356f.mp4?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Survive the onslaught of an endless horde of monsters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kill monsters, gather their eyes, improve yourself!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this roguelite survival game, all you can do is survive as long as you can. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather eyes for level up current run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather credits in each run to buy upgrades and help the next survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/bde07f880803137bf811525a81e62b1b.poster.avif?t=1744965672\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/bde07f880803137bf811525a81e62b1b.webm?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Merge Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Builds Every Run. Select from a variety of upgrades to create a unique and overpowered builds every run. You can be a summoner-Drone Operator, for example, and destroy monsters with drones, or ranged sniper who use electrobullets to pierce enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/9e1824317a975f41bde0df82d69ac72b.poster.avif?t=1744965672\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/9e1824317a975f41bde0df82d69ac72b.webm?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/9e1824317a975f41bde0df82d69ac72b.mp4?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Select Your Hero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a diverse selection of characters and weapons that offer a variety of gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/50f8a4c0e2cd3e9ef3e01c6b2c2877bd.poster.avif?t=1744965672\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/50f8a4c0e2cd3e9ef3e01c6b2c2877bd.webm?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/50f8a4c0e2cd3e9ef3e01c6b2c2877bd.mp4?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 30 different upgrades too choose from for a unique experience every run!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wide cast of characters and their personalities, with more to come post-launch.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casual quick 10-20 minute play sessions, for busy gamers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapon, Orb and Item System helps you become stronger</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Future planned features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cooperative Gameplay. Fight against hordes of enemies with friends</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PvP Gameplay. Play against over players in Moba-style modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/b2d95da44b902ba8dc6b4ec904b8356f.poster.avif?t=1744965672\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/b2d95da44b902ba8dc6b4ec904b8356f.webm?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/b2d95da44b902ba8dc6b4ec904b8356f.mp4?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Survive the onslaught of an endless horde of monsters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kill monsters, gather their eyes, improve yourself!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this roguelite survival game, all you can do is survive as long as you can. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather eyes for level up current run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather credits in each run to buy upgrades and help the next survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/bde07f880803137bf811525a81e62b1b.poster.avif?t=1744965672\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/bde07f880803137bf811525a81e62b1b.webm?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Merge Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Builds Every Run. Select from a variety of upgrades to create a unique and overpowered builds every run. You can be a summoner-Drone Operator, for example, and destroy monsters with drones, or ranged sniper who use electrobullets to pierce enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/9e1824317a975f41bde0df82d69ac72b.poster.avif?t=1744965672\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/9e1824317a975f41bde0df82d69ac72b.webm?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/9e1824317a975f41bde0df82d69ac72b.mp4?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Select Your Hero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a diverse selection of characters and weapons that offer a variety of gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/50f8a4c0e2cd3e9ef3e01c6b2c2877bd.poster.avif?t=1744965672\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/50f8a4c0e2cd3e9ef3e01c6b2c2877bd.webm?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/50f8a4c0e2cd3e9ef3e01c6b2c2877bd.mp4?t=1744965672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 30 different upgrades too choose from for a unique experience every run!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wide cast of characters and their personalities, with more to come post-launch.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casual quick 10-20 minute play sessions, for busy gamers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapon, Orb and Item System helps you become stronger</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Future planned features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cooperative Gameplay. Fight against hordes of enemies with friends</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PvP Gameplay. Play against over players in Moba-style modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
